# Geist / Vercel Design System

Sources of truth:

- [Geist Introduction](https://vercel.com/geist/introduction)
- [Geist Colors](https://vercel.com/geist/colors)
- [Geist Typography](https://vercel.com/geist/typography)
- [Geist Materials](https://vercel.com/geist/materials)
- [Brand guidelines](https://vercel.com/geist/brands) — do not misuse Vercel/Next marks; Sioona stays its own brand
- [Web Interface Guidelines](https://vercel.com/design/guidelines)

Product SoT (what we build): Phase 1 Shadow Mode Insights. Visual SoT (how it looks): Vercel/Geist principles — not Vercel branding, not navy+cyan.

Token architecture follows a Harvey-style **primitive → semantic → component** stack (intent naming only — do not copy Harvey UI/brand). Prefix: **`sio-`**.

## Token layers

1. **Primitives** — `--ds-*` in [`web/src/app/globals.css`](web/src/app/globals.css) (Geist steps). Raw neutrals / accents.
2. **Semantics** — `--sio-*` aliases that map **only** to `--ds-*` (no second palette). Examples: `--sio-bg-base`, `--sio-fg-subtle`, `--sio-border-base`, `--sio-fg-on-color`, signal/status aliases.
3. **Components** — CSS utilities (`.panel`, `.btn-*`, …) and Tailwind `sio-*` classes bind to **semantics**, not primitives.

| Intent | Token | Tailwind example |
|--------|--------|------------------|
| Page / panel fill | `--sio-bg-base` | `bg-sio-bg-base` |
| Quiet / secondary surface | `--sio-bg-subtle` / `--sio-bg-muted` | `bg-sio-bg-muted` |
| Primary text | `--sio-fg-base` | `text-sio-fg-base` |
| Secondary text | `--sio-fg-subtle` | `text-sio-fg-subtle` |
| Text on inverse fill | `--sio-fg-on-color` | `text-sio-fg-on-color` |
| Default border | `--sio-border-base` | `border-sio-border-base` |

**Do not** use `--ds-gray-*` / `text-ds-gray-*` in new component CSS or new utilities. Opportunistic TSX cleanup of leftover `ds-*` classes is fine when touching a file; no full-view codemod required.

## Typography

- **UI/body**: Geist Sans
- **Code/data/tabular**: Geist Mono (`font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums` for comparable numbers)
- Prefer typography roles: `heading-*`, `label-*`, `copy-*` (see Geist typography)
- Default body: copy-14 / label-14. Headings: tight tracking, weight 600

## Color (light theme — product default)

Primitives keep Geist step meaning: `100` bg → hover/highlight → `400` border → `500`/`600` border hover/active → `900` secondary text → `1000` primary text.

Product canvas (light only): page + panels = `#ffffff` (`sio-bg-base` / `background-100`). Borders = `#e5e7eb` 1px (`sio-border-base` ← `gray-400`). Hover / selected / list-row / filter / chrome highlight = `#f2f1f0` (`sio-bg-interactive*` ← `gray-100`). `color-scheme: light` on `<html>`. `theme-color` matches page background.

Accent color signals **state**, not decoration — use semantic signal tokens (`sio-signal-lead-*`, `sio-signal-retention-*`, `sio-signal-upsell-*`). Pair color with text/icon.

## Density & spacing

- Rhythm: 4 / 8 / 12 / 16 / 24 (`--space-*`)
- Prefer `gap-4` / `gap-6` between page sections; avoid stacked bordered boxes
- Controls default height **36px** (`h-9`); filters/nav chrome **32px** (`h-8`)

## Surface ladder

1. **Flush** — no border (page chrome, dividers only)
2. **Quiet** — `.surface-quiet` / `.metric-strip` (border, transparent)
3. **Panel** — `.panel` (`rounded-sm` + border; near-zero shadow)
4. **Group** — `.panel-group` (`rounded-md`) only for large grouped regions

Borders + tonal fills first; avoid card-on-card nesting.

## Shell / sidebar

- Desktop (`md+`): full-height left sidebar (~240px) with logo row **parallel** to main-column `AppHeader` (matched 4rem height) — do not stack a full-bleed header over the sidebar
- Keep sidebar and header separate: logo + Workspace nav in sidebar; page title + ModeToggle + actions in header
- Page title (with view icon) in `AppHeader` for every tab — Insights, Upload, Eval, Taxonomy
- Mobile: header hamburger + slide-over drawer (focus trap, Escape, `overscroll-behavior: contain`)
- Selected nav: `sio-bg-interactive-hover` fill + `sio-fg-base` text (not colored pills)

## Components

- **Primary**: `sio-bg-inverse` fill, `sio-fg-on-color` text, 6px, medium weight
- **Secondary**: border `sio-border-subtle`; hover border `sio-border-strong`
- **Tertiary**: text only; hover interactive tint
- **Focus**: `0 0 0 2px` base bg, `0 0 0 4px` `sio-focus-accent`
- Icons: `@phosphor-icons/react` (use `/ssr` in App Router) — **Bold** for primary nav / key actions; **Regular** for dense chrome (lists, pagers, spinners). Prefer `weight` over stroke hacks; ~16px; `sio-fg-subtle` at rest
- Loading labels end with `…`

## Web interface rules (must follow)

- Keyboard operable; links are real `<a>`/`Link`
- Hit targets ≥24px (44px mobile); `touch-action: manipulation`
- Honor `prefers-reduced-motion`; never `transition: all`
- Title Case for buttons/nav/titles; sentence case for body/helpers
- Action labels: verb + noun; empty/error states offer a next step

## Do not

- Dark mode as product default; atmospheric glows, orbit/grid/star backdrops, luminous pill chrome
- Use Slash gold/Inter/Instrument Serif stacks
- Use Vercel logo/marks in a way that implies endorsement
- Navy+cyan or purple glows / non-token neon accents
- Import Vercel brand CSS or invent a **second** hex palette beside `--ds-*`
- Bind new components to raw `--ds-*` / `ds-*` when a `--sio-*` alias exists
- Copy Harvey (`hy-`) brand, fonts, or layout — only the semantic-token *pattern*
